WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:10.360
Be careful. Portland is on fire. Our president says so. The rival gangs fighting. The clouds

00:10.360 --> 00:19.140
of tear gas all around us. Be careful. But actually, this isn't a war zone, whatever

00:19.140 --> 00:24.020
Trump says. It is perfectly peaceful. Legacy Media doesn't have any reporters

00:24.020 --> 00:29.380
filming the riots, and that's how the chief of police likes it. What bothers him are the

00:29.380 --> 00:31.140
journalists who are fair and balanced.

